      "comment": "ZIPPING NICK (8) hit the frame two on end before getting off the mark with a deserved win last time, scoring at Maitland over 400m (22.88). One of the key runners again. ZIPPING FLORIDA (3) ran a good time (22.87) winning a Maiden two back at Richmond but missed the frame latest finishing eighth at Richmond. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. US TWO BOYS (2) turned in a plain performance last time when eighth at this track over 400m behind Zipper Surprise (23.62) in a Grade 5. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Should play a prominent role. MULLAWAY BUD (1) should be thereabouts.",
